		<Modification_History>
			<Modification_Detail>
				<modification_date>2020-01-08</modification_date>
				<version_id>2.0</version_id>
				<description>The data is organized according to the actual continuous working time of the instrument. For the data of every observation cycle, the first 50 groups of data are averaged as correction coefficient. And for every subsequent signal received by the antenna with a length of 5m is corrected using the corresponding signal received by the short reference antenna and the estimated correction coefficient. The correction coefficient is updated every 24 hours if the observation cycle is longer than 24 hours.</description>
			</Modification_Detail>
			<Modification_Detail>
				<modification_date>2019-01-03</modification_date>
				<version_id>1.0</version_id>
